function drawVillager(v){if(!v||v.hidden)return;if(isMinimalGraphicsMode()){drawMinimalMobileEntity(v,'villager');return;}if(isNewStyleGraphicsMode()){drawNewStyleMobileEntity(v,'villager');return;}let sx=v.x-camera.x,sy=v.y-camera.y;let col=pickFactionColor(v.faction,'#66ff66','#ff7777');ctx.fillStyle=col;ctx.beginPath();ctx.arc(sx,sy,5,0,Math.PI*2);ctx.fill();ctx.fillStyle='rgba(255,255,255,0.35)';ctx.beginPath();ctx.arc(sx-1.5,sy-1.8,2,0,Math.PI*2);ctx.fill();const lifePct=Math.max(0,Math.min(1,(v.life||0)/VILLAGER_LIFE));ctx.strokeStyle=pickFactionRgba(v.faction,'80,255,80','255,120,120',0.35);ctx.lineWidth=1;ctx.beginPath();ctx.arc(sx,sy,8,-Math.PI/2,-Math.PI/2+lifePct*Math.PI*2);ctx.stroke();if(selection.includes(v)){ctx.strokeStyle=col;ctx.setLineDash([2,2]);ctx.beginPath();ctx.arc(sx,sy,12,0,Math.PI*2);ctx.stroke();ctx.setLineDash([]);}}
function drawRailTurnRails(type,style){
  const o=style.railOffset||4;
  const mid=TILE/2;
  let spec=null;
  if(type==='turn-ne')spec={cx:TILE,cy:0,a0:Math.PI,a1:Math.PI/2,ac:true};
  else if(type==='turn-se')spec={cx:TILE,cy:TILE,a0:-Math.PI/2,a1:Math.PI,ac:true};
  else if(type==='turn-sw')spec={cx:0,cy:TILE,a0:0,a1:-Math.PI/2,ac:true};
  else if(type==='turn-nw')spec={cx:0,cy:0,a0:Math.PI/2,a1:0,ac:true};
  if(!spec)return;
  ctx.strokeStyle=style.rail;
  ctx.lineWidth=style.railWidth||2;
  ctx.beginPath();
  ctx.arc(spec.cx,spec.cy,Math.max(1,mid-o),spec.a0,spec.a1,spec.ac);
  ctx.arc(spec.cx,spec.cy,mid+o,spec.a0,spec.a1,spec.ac);
  ctx.stroke();
}function drawRail(r){
  let sx=r.x-camera.x,sy=r.y-camera.y;
  const mask=getRailVisualConnections(r);
  const type=getRailVisualTypeFromMask(mask);
  const col=pickFactionColor(r.faction,'#9fe8ff','#ffb07a');
  const style=isMinimalGraphicsMode()?{ballast:'rgba(78,78,86,0.34)',sleeper:'rgba(176,132,82,0.86)',rail:col,railWidth:1.45,tieWidth:1.3,tieHalf:4.3,ballastHalf:6.2,railOffset:3.4,step:8}:
    isBeautyGraphicsMode()?{ballast:'rgba(54,58,66,0.82)',sleeper:'rgba(145,104,64,0.95)',rail:'rgba(224,238,248,0.98)',railWidth:2.15,tieWidth:2.2,tieHalf:5.8,ballastHalf:8.4,railOffset:4.5,step:7}:
    isNewStyleGraphicsMode()?{ballast:'rgba(52,58,68,0.84)',sleeper:'rgba(154,114,72,0.96)',rail:'rgba(212,232,244,0.98)',railWidth:2.0,tieWidth:2.05,tieHalf:5.35,ballastHalf:7.9,railOffset:4.2,step:7}:
    {ballast:'rgba(60,64,74,0.84)',sleeper:'rgba(166,118,72,0.96)',rail:'rgba(216,232,244,0.98)',railWidth:1.95,tieWidth:2.0,tieHalf:5.3,ballastHalf:7.8,railOffset:4.1,step:7};
  ctx.save();
  ctx.translate(Math.round(sx),Math.round(sy));
  const cx=TILE/2,cy=TILE/2;
  if(isBeautyGraphicsMode()){
    ctx.fillStyle='rgba(0,0,0,0.18)';
    ctx.beginPath();
    ctx.ellipse(cx,cy+8,13,5,0,0,Math.PI*2);
    ctx.fill();
  }
  for(const dir of ['n','e','s','w'])if(mask[dir])drawRailArmBallast(cx,cy,dir,style);
  ctx.fillStyle=style.ballast;
  if(ctx.roundRect){
    ctx.beginPath();
    ctx.roundRect(cx-(style.ballastHalf||8),cy-(style.ballastHalf||8),(style.ballastHalf||8)*2,(style.ballastHalf||8)*2,2);
    ctx.fill();
  }else{
    ctx.fillRect(cx-(style.ballastHalf||8),cy-(style.ballastHalf||8),(style.ballastHalf||8)*2,(style.ballastHalf||8)*2);
  }

  for(const dir of ['n','e','s','w'])if(mask[dir])drawRailArmSleepers(cx,cy,dir,style);
  ctx.strokeStyle=style.sleeper;
  ctx.lineWidth=style.tieWidth||2;
  ctx.beginPath();
  if(type.startsWith('turn-')){
    if(type==='turn-ne'){ctx.moveTo(cx-2,cy+2);ctx.lineTo(cx+6,cy-6);}
    else if(type==='turn-se'){ctx.moveTo(cx-2,cy-2);ctx.lineTo(cx+6,cy+6);}
    else if(type==='turn-sw'){ctx.moveTo(cx+2,cy-2);ctx.lineTo(cx-6,cy+6);}
    else if(type==='turn-nw'){ctx.moveTo(cx+2,cy+2);ctx.lineTo(cx-6,cy-6);}
  }else{
    ctx.moveTo(cx-5,cy);ctx.lineTo(cx+5,cy);
    ctx.moveTo(cx,cy-5);ctx.lineTo(cx,cy+5);
  }
  ctx.stroke();

  if(type.startsWith('turn-'))drawRailTurnRails(type,style);
  else for(const dir of ['n','e','s','w'])if(mask[dir])drawRailArmRails(cx,cy,dir,style);

  ctx.fillStyle='rgba(210,220,230,0.82)';
  ctx.fillRect(cx-3,cy-3,6,6);
  if(type==='isolated'){
    ctx.strokeStyle=style.rail;
    ctx.lineWidth=style.railWidth||2;
    ctx.beginPath();
    ctx.moveTo(cx-6,cy-6);ctx.lineTo(cx+6,cy+6);
    ctx.moveTo(cx+6,cy-6);ctx.lineTo(cx-6,cy+6);
    ctx.stroke();
  }
  if(isMinimalGraphicsMode()){
    ctx.strokeStyle=col;ctx.lineWidth=1;ctx.strokeRect(1.5,1.5,TILE-3,TILE-3);
  }else if(isBeautyGraphicsMode()){
    ctx.strokeStyle='rgba(255,255,255,0.10)';ctx.lineWidth=1;ctx.strokeRect(2.5,2.5,TILE-5,TILE-5);
  }
  if(selection.includes(r)){
    ctx.strokeStyle='#fff';ctx.setLineDash([3,2]);ctx.strokeRect(-2,-2,TILE+4,TILE+4);ctx.setLineDash([]);
  }
  ctx.restore();
}

function hasTransportableSelectionForHover(){
  if(!selection||!selection.length)return false;
  for(const e of selection){
    if(!e||e.faction!=='player'||e.hp<=0)continue;
    if(e.type==='base'||e.type==='train'||e.type==='tower'||e.type==='wall'||e.type==='house'||e.type==='apartment'||e.type==='training'||e.type==='harbor'||e.type==='rail'||e.type==='crane'||e.type==='silo'||e.type==='radar')continue;
    return true;
  }
  return false;
}
function getHoveredTransportEndpointCandidate(){
  if(mode==='rail-transport'||!mouseOverCanvas||!hasTransportableSelectionForHover())return null;
  const wx=mouseScreenX+camera.x,wy=mouseScreenY+camera.y;
  const hit=getRailTransportEndpointAt(wx,wy);
  return(hit&&hit.faction==='player'&&(hit.type==='base'||hit.type==='train'))?hit:null;
}
function isTransportEndpointHoverTarget(entity){
  return !!entity&&getHoveredTransportEndpointCandidate()===entity;
}
function drawTransportEndpointHoverGlow(entity,kind){
  if(!entity)return;
  const pulse=(Math.sin(tick*0.26)+1)*0.5;
  const sx=entity.x-camera.x,sy=entity.y-camera.y;
  const w=(kind==='base')?TILE*2:TILE;
  const h=(kind==='base')?TILE*2:TILE;
  const glow=0.16+0.12*pulse;
  ctx.save();
  ctx.fillStyle=`rgba(255,213,74,${0.08+glow*0.45})`;
  if(kind==='base')ctx.fillRect(sx-4,sy-4,w+8,h+8);
  else ctx.fillRect(sx-3,sy-3,w+6,h+6);
  ctx.strokeStyle=`rgba(255,213,74,${0.58+0.24*pulse})`;
  ctx.lineWidth=2.2;
  ctx.setLineDash([8,5]);
  ctx.strokeRect(sx-3.5,sy-3.5,w+7,h+7);
  ctx.setLineDash([]);
  ctx.beginPath();
  ctx.arc(sx+w*0.5,sy+h*0.5,Math.max(w,h)*0.34+4+pulse*3,0,Math.PI*2);
  ctx.strokeStyle=`rgba(255,238,170,${0.20+0.16*pulse})`;
  ctx.lineWidth=1.25;
  ctx.stroke();
  ctx.fillStyle='rgba(6,10,16,0.88)';
  const label=kind==='base'?'BASE = CÍL':'NÁDRAŽÍ = CÍL';
  const lx=Math.round(sx+w*0.5),ly=Math.round(sy-9);
  ctx.font='bold 9px monospace';
  ctx.textAlign='center';
  const tw=Math.ceil(ctx.measureText(label).width)+12;
  ctx.fillRect(lx-tw/2,ly-9,tw,12);
  ctx.strokeStyle='rgba(255,213,74,0.72)';
  ctx.strokeRect(lx-tw/2+0.5,ly-8.5,tw-1,11);
  ctx.fillStyle='#ffe08a';
  ctx.fillText(label,lx,ly);
  ctx.restore();
}
function getStationShuttleHeading(station){
  const sh=station&&station.shuttle;
  if(!sh)return{x:1,y:0};
  if(sh.heading&&Number.isFinite(sh.heading.x)&&Number.isFinite(sh.heading.y)&&(Math.abs(sh.heading.x)+Math.abs(sh.heading.y))>0.5)return sh.heading;
  const route=findContinuousRailRouteForStation(station);
  if(!route||!route.points||route.points.length<2){
    if(sh.routeDir==='toStation')return{x:-1,y:0};
    return{x:1,y:0};
  }
  const points=(sh.state==='toStation')?route.points.slice().reverse():route.points;
  const idx=Math.max(0,Math.min(points.length-2,sh.routeIndex|0));
  const a=points[idx],b=points[Math.min(points.length-1,idx+1)]||a;
  let dx=(b.x-a.x),dy=(b.y-a.y);
  if(Math.abs(dx)<0.001&&Math.abs(dy)<0.001){
    if(sh.routeDir==='toStation'){dx=-1;dy=0;}else{dx=1;dy=0;}
  }
  if(Math.abs(dx)>=Math.abs(dy))return{x:dx>=0?1:-1,y:0};
  return{x:0,y:dy>=0?1:-1};
}
function getRailVisualConnections(r){
  const tx=Math.round(r.x/TILE),ty=Math.round(r.y/TILE),fac=r.faction;
  const mask={n:isRailTileForFaction(fac,tx,ty-1),e:isRailTileForFaction(fac,tx+1,ty),s:isRailTileForFaction(fac,tx,ty+1),w:isRailTileForFaction(fac,tx-1,ty)};
  const facObj=getFaction(fac);
  for(const base of (facObj&&facObj.bases)||[]){
    if(!base||base.hp<=0)continue;
    const bx=Math.round(base.x/TILE),by=Math.round(base.y/TILE);
    if(tx>=bx&&tx<=bx+1&&ty===by-1)mask.s=true;
    if(tx>=bx&&tx<=bx+1&&ty===by+2)mask.n=true;
    if(tx===bx-1&&ty>=by&&ty<=by+1)mask.e=true;
    if(tx===bx+2&&ty>=by&&ty<=by+1)mask.w=true;
  }
  for(const st of (facObj&&facObj.trains)||[]){
    if(!st||st.hp<=0)continue;
    const sx=Math.round(st.x/TILE),sy=Math.round(st.y/TILE);
    if(tx===sx&&ty===sy-1)mask.s=true;
    if(tx===sx&&ty===sy+1)mask.n=true;
    if(tx===sx-1&&ty===sy)mask.e=true;
    if(tx===sx+1&&ty===sy)mask.w=true;
  }
  return mask;
}
function getRailVisualTypeFromMask(mask){
  const dirs=[];if(mask.n)dirs.push('n');if(mask.e)dirs.push('e');if(mask.s)dirs.push('s');if(mask.w)dirs.push('w');
  const key=dirs.join('');
  if(dirs.length===4)return 'cross';
  if(dirs.length===3)return key==='nes'?'t-west':key==='new'?'t-south':key==='nsw'?'t-east':'t-north';
  if(dirs.length===2){
    if((mask.e&&mask.w)&&!mask.n&&!mask.s)return 'straight-h';
    if((mask.n&&mask.s)&&!mask.e&&!mask.w)return 'straight-v';
    if(mask.n&&mask.e)return 'turn-ne';
    if(mask.e&&mask.s)return 'turn-se';
    if(mask.s&&mask.w)return 'turn-sw';
    if(mask.w&&mask.n)return 'turn-nw';
  }
  if(dirs.length===1)return 'end-'+dirs[0];
  return 'isolated';
}
function drawRailArmSleepers(cx,cy,dir,style){
  const step=style.step||7,half=style.tieHalf||5,railOffset=style.railOffset||4;
  ctx.strokeStyle=style.sleeper;
  ctx.lineWidth=style.tieWidth||2;
  ctx.beginPath();
  if(dir==='n')for(let y=cy-4;y>=4;y-=step){ctx.moveTo(cx-half,y);ctx.lineTo(cx+half,y);} 
  else if(dir==='s')for(let y=cy+4;y<=TILE-4;y+=step){ctx.moveTo(cx-half,y);ctx.lineTo(cx+half,y);} 
  else if(dir==='e')for(let x=cx+4;x<=TILE-4;x+=step){ctx.moveTo(x,cy-half);ctx.lineTo(x,cy+half);} 
  else if(dir==='w')for(let x=cx-4;x>=4;x-=step){ctx.moveTo(x,cy-half);ctx.lineTo(x,cy+half);} 
  ctx.stroke();
}
function drawRailArmRails(cx,cy,dir,style){
  const o=style.railOffset||4;
  ctx.strokeStyle=style.rail;
  ctx.lineWidth=style.railWidth||2;
  ctx.beginPath();
  if(dir==='n'){ctx.moveTo(cx-o,cy);ctx.lineTo(cx-o,1);ctx.moveTo(cx+o,cy);ctx.lineTo(cx+o,1);} 
  else if(dir==='s'){ctx.moveTo(cx-o,cy);ctx.lineTo(cx-o,TILE-1);ctx.moveTo(cx+o,cy);ctx.lineTo(cx+o,TILE-1);} 
  else if(dir==='e'){ctx.moveTo(cx,cy-o);ctx.lineTo(TILE-1,cy-o);ctx.moveTo(cx,cy+o);ctx.lineTo(TILE-1,cy+o);} 
  else if(dir==='w'){ctx.moveTo(cx,cy-o);ctx.lineTo(1,cy-o);ctx.moveTo(cx,cy+o);ctx.lineTo(1,cy+o);} 
  ctx.stroke();
}
function drawRailArmBallast(cx,cy,dir,style){
  const hw=style.ballastHalf||7;
  ctx.fillStyle=style.ballast;
  if(dir==='n')ctx.fillRect(cx-hw,0,hw*2,cy+2);
  else if(dir==='s')ctx.fillRect(cx-hw,cy-2,hw*2,TILE-cy+2);
  else if(dir==='e')ctx.fillRect(cx-2,cy-hw,TILE-cx+2,hw*2);
  else if(dir==='w')ctx.fillRect(0,cy-hw,cx+2,hw*2);
}
